{
    "title": "Food Run",
    "description": "Play with thousands of foods! Go through gates to get even more!\r\n\r\nYou can even feed your food to other foods! Yum!\r\n\r\nHIGHLIGHTS\r\n\u25c9 Tons of cute and kawaii foods to discover\r\n\u25c9 Control a huge crowd of foods - so many that you'll lose count!\r\n\u25c9 Lots of hats to decorate your foods with\r\n\u25c9 Simple and addictive gameplay!\r\n\u25c9 Collect coins and become rich!\r\n\u25c9 Play while offline! No wifi needed!\r\n\r\nTHE STORY\r\nIt's a crazy world, there's food running around everywhere! Help guide the cute foods through the level as they race towards the end. Feed the foods to other foods at the end of the level to unlock even more foods! Keep playing to discover more foods and surprises!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\nGameplay is simple and addicting! Tap to start running down the road and swipe left and right to go through gates. If you can get to the end of the level, your foods will jump into another food's mouth to feed it! Use the coins to upgrade your number of foods and coins to make even more money! Easy to play, hard to master!\r\n\r\nPLAY OFFLINE\r\nInternet is not required to play this game! Enjoy!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play with thousands of foods! Go through gates to get even more!<br><br>You can even feed your food to other foods! Yum!<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS<br>\u25c9 Tons of cute and kawaii foods to discover<br>\u25c9 Control a huge crowd of foods - so many that you&#39;ll lose count!<br>\u25c9 Lots of hats to decorate your foods with<br>\u25c9 Simple and addictive gameplay!<br>\u25c9 Collect coins and become rich!<br>\u25c9 Play while offline! No wifi needed!<br><br>THE STORY<br>It&#39;s a crazy world, there&#39;s food running around everywhere! Help guide the cute foods through the level as they race towards the end. Feed the foods to other foods at the end of the level to unlock even more foods! Keep playing to discover more foods and surprises!<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>Gameplay is simple and addicting! Tap to start running down the road and swipe left and right to go through gates. If you can get to the end of the level, your foods will jump into another food&#39;s mouth to feed it! Use the coins to upgrade your number of foods and coins to make even more money! Easy to play, hard to master!<br><br>PLAY OFFLINE<br>Internet is not required to play this game! Enjoy!",
